### 6. Create order with lines
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pedidos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-corr-order-create

{
  "customer": "Alice Smith",
  "lines": [
    {
      "sku": "SKU-KEYBOARD",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 7. Get order by ID (critical read)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pedidos/1001
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-corr-order-get

### 8. List and filter orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pedidos?status=PENDIENTE
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-corr-order-list

### 9. Cancel confirmed or pending order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pedidos/1001/cancelar
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-corr-order-cancel
